msgctxt "help:ir.action.report,html_file_name:"
msgid ""
"By default, the file name is generated from the report name and the record’s"
" full name. To customize the file name, define a Jinja2 pattern. The record "
"is evaluated as a DualRecord, so fields must be accessed through raw or "
"render. Example: demo-{{ record.render.rec_name }}"
msgstr ""
"默认文件名由报表名称和记录全名生成。要自定义文件名，请定义 Jinja2 模式。记录按 DualRecord 处理，因此必须通过 raw 或 "
"render 访问字段。例如：demo-{{ record.render.rec_name }}"

msgctxt "help:ir.action.report,html_zipped:"
msgid "If set, a zip file with a document per record will be created."
msgstr "设置后，将创建 ZIP 文件，每条记录生成一个文档。"

